# ssh/known_hosts
#
# The controller's known hosts for raw nodes admitted by
# ingress/playbooks/05_admit.yml. Committed: host keys are public, and git
# history records when a node's keys were first trusted or changed
# (privileged access policy PA-HOST-02).
#
# Entries are keyed by inventory hostname, not address: the admitted group
# connects with HostKeyAlias=<inventory_hostname>, so a node keeps its keys
# when its DHCP address changes. Each node's keys sit in a block that
# 05_admit.yml writes. To forget a node, for example before re-admitting a
# reinstalled one: ssh-keygen -R <hostname> -f ssh/known_hosts
